Subject: [PATCH 38/48] bench: time ML-DSA-44 verification next to BIP-340
 verification

M1 charges an ML-DSA-44 check against the BIP 342 validation budget,
where a BIP-340 check costs 50. VerifyMLDSA44 and VerifySchnorrBIP340
run the two verifications in one process, so their ratio on a given
machine is read off one run. The Schnorr case includes parsing the
x-only key, as every tapscript signature check does.
---
 src/bench/CMakeLists.txt |  1 +
 src/bench/mldsa44.cpp    | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 63 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/bench/mldsa44.cpp

diff --git a/src/bench/CMakeLists.txt b/src/bench/CMakeLists.txt
